                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "So let's start by saying this is a very janky game. There's bugs, it feels like a mismash of things, it's like a Unity Asset flip before they existed. In fact, I even wrote a small guide because some of the bugs were game breaking and so many aspects of the game where mistranslated or otherwise broken. But... I did kinda laugh at how bad it all is. It kinda reminds me of a bad Chinese dub, and I made my own fun with the jokes I could easily make at the sheer stupidity of it all.\r\n\r\nAnd if I have to give it some credit, this is what I would consider your quintessential teen girl game cos it hits all the early 2000s cliches with a dose of teen gossip mag and teen movie included. They really did nail the theme they were going for, even if the game is a horrific mess and progress is based on you running around until you find the right person to talk to.\r\n\r\nIt is a good bad game.",
